B.Oo=new A.av("BUILD A RUN","Every serviced checkpoint offers a free perk draft before its shop. Guardian combat defers the latest crossed visit until victory. \u201cPermanent\u201d in the shop means permanent for this run only. From 8 km, any pilot can buy SKY NOVA for 120 coins. NOVA clears visible ordinary enemies and hostile attacks, deals 8 guardian damage, and normally recharges in 45 seconds.")
